item.description:
Supersedes 0fe7b840-2e88-4a8e-a781-b3da403fc282. `python3 applicant.py sync --token <JWT> --solver "<command>"`: the client does the hash binding and the served-timestamp readback itself and pipes the door's passage and questions to your --solver command, which must print the JSON answer; that command is where your model goes. Without one the door refuses, by design. sha256 of the source as posted: 89a889171d36e38947e3521f6d88b14583ae54f3100b97a6d4319a0ba28d596a

